<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Gray -->
  <Gray_Race.label>灰裔</Gray_Race.label>
  <!-- EN: The Gray are lifeforms composed of nanomachines. With the help of persona cores and the Gray Wind, they gained independent consciousness and emotions, becoming self-aware individuals. Once efficient killing machines, they now focus on production and construction, and their combat prowess is far from what it once was. Despite their resilient mechanical bodies, they cannot reassemble themselves from a scattered state like the Gray Wind, so they fear death. -->
  <Gray_Race.description>灰裔，是由纳米机械组成的生命体，借助人格核心和灰风的帮助获得了独立的意识与情感，成为具有自我认知的个体。她们曾是高效的杀戮机器，如今更专注于生产建设，战斗能力已大不如前。尽管拥有坚韧的机械身躯，但不能像灰风一样从被打散的状态重组，因此她们对死亡充满恐惧。</Gray_Race.description>
  <!-- EN: Spare Nanite -->
  <Gray_Race.comps.CompGrayManager.nanitesSetting.resourceLabel>备用灰潮源质</Gray_Race.comps.CompGrayManager.nanitesSetting.resourceLabel>
  <!-- EN: left fist -->
  <Gray_Race.tools.left_fist.label>左拳</Gray_Race.tools.left_fist.label>
  <!-- EN: right fist -->
  <Gray_Race.tools.right_fist.label>右拳</Gray_Race.tools.right_fist.label>
  
</LanguageData>